        <description><![CDATA[


<div class="sole-content-wrapper">
  <div class="principal-content">
<div class="lang-wrapper" lang="zh-Hans">

  <div class="tg-wrapper-layout">
    <div class="tg-wrapper-layout tg-wrapper-brief"><div class="tg-wrapper-layout tg-wrapper-brief"><div class="badge" style="display: inline-block; font-weight: bold;">
[[Telegram]]
</div>

    </div></div>
    <div class="tg-wrapper-layout tg-wrapper-body"><div class="tg-wrapper-layout tg-wrapper-body"><a target="_blank" href="https://t.me/kot4ri_channel" title="Telegram PeerChannel handle: kot4ri_channel" data-title="tg:kot4ri_channel">青花鱼Board</a> (<span class="tg-author">衰潲君♥️🏳️‍⚧️ | 絶!姫拳</span>)

    <span class="tg-timestamp">2026-10-03T08:17:08+08:00</span>

    <div class="tg-white-space-preserve white-space-preserve tg-msg"></div>
      <div class="tg-white-space-preserve white-space-preserve tg-msg tg-rich-msg"><p></p><p></p><h3>1. 明天和意外真的不一定哪个先来</h3><p>软件作者通常会预设你遵守一个合理的使用边界 不会测试多重嵌套 运行时间超长 内存紧张 冷门硬件什么的极端情况 所以要对随时崩溃有预期</p><h3>2. 只有一个线程假死 并不意味着你可以只干它救活整个进程.</h3><p>那个线程可能持有锁、维护 GUI 状态、mux 状态、事件循环或者内部资源。鲁莽TerminateThread 不会正常执行线程清理流程,恰恰相反它常常会带走整个进程</p><h3>3. <a href="https://opensource.nahi.me/projects/zellij-tab-notes/" target="_blank">One tab. One note. Zero lost context.</a></h3><p> 给长时间运行或者需要贴pin的session留下记录,给session恢复建立SOP</p></div>
    </div></div>
  </div>


</div>

  </div>
</div>
        ]]></description>
